---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/pages.css';
---
<Layout
  page="accessibility"
  title="Accessibility statement for the Avishkar AI website"
  description="How the Avishkar AI website supports keyboard use, screen readers, contrast and reduced motion, and how to tell us about a barrier you found."
  mainClass="legal"
><section class="wrap lg-hero hl"><div class="crumb fx"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Legal</span><span>/</span><span class="text-fg!">Accessibility</span></div><h1 class="d1"><span class="ln"><span style="--i:0">Accessibility</span></span></h1><p class="lead fx" style="--d:.4s">This website should work with a keyboard, a screen reader, and reduced motion.</p><div class="lg-meta fx" style="--d:.55s"><span>Last updated 10 October 2026</span><nav class="lg-tabs" aria-label="Legal documents"><a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a><a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a><a href="/accessibility" class="on" aria-current="page">Accessibility</a></nav></div></section><section class="wrap lg-grid"><aside class="lg-toc"><p class="lab">On this page</p><ol><li><a href="#s1"><b>01</b>What we aim for</a></li><li><a href="#s2"><b>02</b>What you can expect</a></li><li><a href="#s3"><b>03</b>Known limits</a></li><li><a href="#s4"><b>04</b>Tell us about a barrier</a></li></ol></aside><article class="lg-body"><section class="lg-sec lg-card" id="s1"><h2><span>01</span>What we aim for</h2><p>Avishkar AI, operated by Anjaneyaai Technologies Private Limited, aims to meet WCAG 2.2 level AA on this marketing website.</p></section><section class="lg-sec" id="s2"><h2><span>02</span>What you can expect</h2><ul><li>Pages can be used with a keyboard. Focus is visible on links, buttons and form fields.</li><li>Images that carry meaning have text alternatives.</li><li>Text keeps contrast in both the light and dark themes, and colour is not the only way a state is shown.</li><li>When your system asks for reduced motion, looping animation is held still.</li><li>Forms name every field and explain an error next to the field that needs a change.</li></ul></section><section class="lg-sec" id="s3"><h2><span>03</span>Known limits</h2><p>The home page opens with a canvas illustration. A text alternative for that mark is in the footer. Some older documents we link to were written before this statement.</p></section><section class="lg-sec lg-card" id="s4"><h2><span>04</span>Tell us about a barrier</h2><p>If something on this site blocks you, email <a href="mailto:arpit@avishkarai.com">arpit@avishkarai.com</a> with the page address and what you were trying to do.</p></section></article></section><Fragment slot="scripts"><script>
  import '../scripts/core.js';
  import '../scripts/pages.js';
</script></Fragment></Layout>
